### Keyword tour: committee (ensemble) uncertainty estimation.
###
### Task COMMITTEE evaluates networks that are already trained: it reads
### the member weight files, writes the mean and the sample standard
### deviation of every carried slot at every input point, and stops.  No
### training, no history, no checkpoints.
###
### The members are independently trained networks, so one run cannot
### produce them.  Run ./train_members.sh first: it trains four members
### that differ only in Rand_seed.
###
### With Output_deriv 1 the dense first-order set is carried, so the
### spread of dN/dx is reported next to the spread of the value.  That is
### the quantity an on-the-fly scheme thresholds when it decides whether
### the expensive reference calculation must be called.
Task COMMITTEE /
Committee 4 /
member_101.dat
member_202.dat
member_303.dat
member_404.dat
Output_deriv 1 /
Init_w       Glorot_norm
Nlayer       4 / L
1 / ndim(1)
12 /
12 /
1 / ndim(L)
Loss_term  DATA  200  train.dat  1.d0 /
Epoch      1 /
Num_batch  20 /
GD_method  Adam
GD_param   0.01d0 0.9d0 0.999d0 1.d-8 0.d0 /
